          "descriptionHtml": "<p>The triple-decker ferry capsized about one nautical mile from Baluk-baluk Island shortly after midnight on the Zamboanga City–Jolo run, with 332 passengers and 27 crew aboard. At least 31 died and 10 were missing; 316 people were rescued. DOTR grounded Aleson Shipping's passenger fleet pending a nationwide safety audit.</p>",
